}{\plain \fs16 \i\f4\fs16 the Three Creeds; and began as follows, {\u8220\'93}The Three Creeds, Nicene Creed, Athanasius{\u8217\'92}s \par
}{\plain \fs16 \i\f4\fs16 Creed, and that which is commonly called the Apostles' Creed . . .{\u8221\'94}}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
