}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx2286\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f6\fs16 The Offering of Christ once made is that perfect redemption, propitiation, and satisfaction, \par
