}{\plain \fs16 \f6\fs16 satisfaction for sin, but that alone.  Wherefore the sacrifices of Masses, in the which it was\par
}{\plain \fs16 \f6\fs16 commonly said, that the Priest did offer Christ for the quick and the dead, to have remission \par
