}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 Christ, and James his Apostle, so we judge, that Christian Religion doth not prohibit, but \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 that a man may swear when the Magistrate requireth, in a cause of faith and charity, so it be \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 done according to the Prophet{\u8217\'92}s teaching in justice, judgment, and truth.\par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \b\f4 The Chicago-Lambeth Quadrilateral 1886, 1888}{\plain \fs24 \f4 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f4 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f4 Adopted by the House of Bishops\par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f4 Chicago, }{\plain \fs24 \i\f5 1886}{\plain \fs24 \f4 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 We, Bishops of the Protestant Episcopal Church in the United States of America, in Council \softline
assembled as Bishops in the Church of God, do hereby solemnly declare to all whom it may \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 concern, and especially to our fellow-Christians of the different Communions in this land, \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 who, in their several spheres, have contended for the religion of Christ:\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 1}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 .  \ul0 \tab Our earnest desire that the Saviour{\u8217\'92}s prayer, {\u8220\'93}That we all may be one,{\u8221\'94} may, in its \par
}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 deepest and truest sense, be speedily fulfilled;\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 2}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 .  \ul0 \tab That we believe that all who have been duly baptized with water, in the name of the \par
}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 Father, and of the Son, and of the Holy Ghost, are members of the Holy Catholic Church.\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 3}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 .  \ul0 \tab That in all things of human ordering or human choice, relating to modes of worship \par
}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 and discipline, or to traditional customs, this Church is ready in the spirit of love and \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 humility to forego all preferences of her own;\par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\page 
\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 4}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 .  \ul0 \tab That this Church does not seek to absorb other Communions, but rather, co-operating \par
}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 with them on the basis of a common Faith and Order, to discountenance schism, to heal the \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 wounds of the Body of Christ, and to promote the charity which is the chief of Christian \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 graces and the visible manifestation of Christ to the world.\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 But furthermore, we do hereby affirm that the Christian unity . . . can be restored only by \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 the return of all Christian communions to the principles of unity exemplified by the \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 undivided Catholic Church during the first ages of its existence; which principles we believe \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 to be the substantial deposit of Christian Faith and Order committed by Christ and his \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 Apostles to the Church unto the end of the world, and therefore incapable of compromise \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 or surrender by those who have been ordained to be its stewards and trustees for the \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 common and equal benefit of all men.\par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 As inherent parts of this sacred deposit, and therefore as essential to the restoration of unity \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 among the divided branches of Christendom, we account the following, to wit:\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 1}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 .  \ul0 \tab The Holy Scriptures of the Old and New Testaments as the revealed Word of God.\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 2}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 .  \ul0 \tab The Nicene Creed as the sufficient statement of the Christian Faith.\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 3}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 . \ul0 \tab  The two Sacraments, {\u8212\'97} Baptism and the Supper of the Lord, {\u8212\'97} ministered with \par
}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 unfailing use of Christ{\u8217\'92}s words of institution and of the elements ordained by Him.\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}\pard \fs16\fi-306\li306\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 
{\plain \fs16 \f5\fs16 4}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 . \ul0 \tab  The Historic Episcopate, locally adapted in the methods of its administration to the \par
}\pard \fs16\tx0\tx306\tx1116\tx3096\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640
{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 varying needs of the nations and peoples called of God into the unity of His Church.\par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \i\f4\fs16 Furthermore}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 , Deeply grieved by the sad divisions which affect the Christian Church in \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 our own land, we hereby declare our desire and readiness, so soon as there shall be any \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 authorized response to this Declaration, to enter into brotherly conference with all or any\par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 Christian Bodies seeking the restoration of the organic unity of the Church, with a view to \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 the earnest study of the conditions under which so priceless a blessing might happily be \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 brought to pass.\par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs14 \i\f4\fs14 Note:  While the above form of the Quadrilateral was adopted by the House of Bishops, it was not \par
}{\plain \fs14 \i\f4\fs14 enacted by the House of Deputies, but rather incorporated in a general plan referred for study and action \par
}{\plain \fs14 \i\f4\fs14 to a newly created Joint Commission on Christian Reunion.}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \i\f4 Lambeth Conference of }{\plain \fs24 \i\f5 1888}{\plain \fs24 \i\f4 \par
