{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 1.  The Golden Number prefixed to a day in the month of March or of April in the Calendar \par
}{\plain \fs16 \f4\fs16 marks the date of the full moon in that year.\par
}\pard \fs16\sl120\slmult1\tx0\tx486\tx1296\tx1926\tx2556\tx3186\tx3816\tx4446\tx5076\tx5706\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640 {\*\pn \pnlvlcont}
